issue_context.body:
when initializing `<Excalidraw />` with 
```
initialData = {
  elements: convertToExcalidrawElements([
    {
      type: "frame",
      children: [],
      x: 300,
      y: 300,
      height: 100,
      width: 100,
    },
  ]),
};
```


x and y values are ignored no matter what, as they seem to be calculated from children, only workaround I found around this, is not to use `convertToExcalidrawElements`, but instead just to drop in raw data as `initialData` and it renders fine

